  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220ºC/200ºC fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Place cauliflower on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Spread out evenly, then roast until tender and brown around edges, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-4ed7ae00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds. Finely chop garlic. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, combine half the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add Greek-style yoghurt to garlic oil, stirring to combine. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-6c418c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan over medium-high heat, heat enough olive oil to coat th the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chick'n until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook brown onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the remaining garlic and lentils and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-841a7d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the pan with lentils, add the water and vegetable stock and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-bfb14930.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cucumber and a drizzle of olive oil and white wine vinegar. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-1b2a1c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide spiced lentil-couscous between bowls.\n• Top with salad and roasted cauliflower.\n• Drizzle over Greek-style yoghurt. Sprinkle over roasted almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185ae05fc1830ec44f0ee/step-a4be5050.jpg"
    }
  ]
